COOKIE(6)                GAMES AND DEMOS                COOKIE(6)NAME     cookie - show a fortune cookieSYNOPSIS     cookie [ sayings hash-file ]     /usr/local/lib/cookhash < sayings > hash-fileDESCRIPTION     _C_o_o_k_i_e shows the user a randomly chosen quote  from  a  file     containing   fortune  cookies,  sayings,  jokes,  aphorisms,     quotes and so on.  Those likely to be offended by words  and     ideas  that  are  alien  to  them  are asked to not read the     cookie file.  If you find quotes in the file that are  unat-     tributed  and you know the attributions, please mail them to     karl@sugar.uu.net or uunet!sugar!karl.  Cookie can  also  be     executed  with two arguments, the name of a cookie file fol-     lowed by the name of its hash  file.   To  create  the  hash     file,  use  /_u_s_r/_l_o_c_a_l/_l_i_b/_c_o_o_k_h_a_s_h  which reads the sayings     from standard input and writes the hash values  to  standard     output.   Sayings  within  the  input  file are separated by     lines containing %% .SEE ALSO     fortune(6)FILES     /usr/local/lib/sayings, /usr/local/lib/sayhashAUTHOR     Karl Lehenbauer @ The Hacker's Haven, Missouri  City,  Texas     -- 12-Jan-89